        "mode": "runOnceForEachItem",
        "jsCode": "const contractPdf =\n`%PDF-1.4\n1 0 obj << /Type /Catalog /Pages 2 0 R >> endobj\n2 0 obj << /Type /Pages /Kids [3 0 R] /Count 1 >> endobj\n3 0 obj << /Type /Page /Parent 2 0 R /MediaBox [0 0 612 792] /Contents 4 0 R /Resources << /Font << /F1 5 0 R >> >> >> endobj\n4 0 obj << /Length 260 >> stream\nBT\n/F1 12 Tf\n72 700 Td (EMPLOYMENT CONTRACT & ONBOARDING REQUISITION) Tj\n0 -25 Td (CANDIDATE: Dr. Alexander Vance) Tj\n0 -20 Td (EMAIL: alexander.vance@enterprise-labs.io) Tj\n0 -20 Td (ROLE: Principal AI Systems Architect) Tj\n0 -20 Td (DEPARTMENT: Engineering) Tj\n0 -20 Td (START_DATE: 2026-11-01) Tj\n0 -20 Td (SALARY: 245000 USD) Tj\n0 -20 Td (SECURITY_CLEARANCE: LEVEL_4) Tj\nET\nendstream endobj\n5 0 obj << /Type /Font /Subtype /Type1 /BaseFont /Helvetica >> endobj\nxref\n0 6\n0000000000 65535 f\n0000000009 00000 n\n0000000058 00000 n\n0000000115 00000 n\n0000000244 00000 n\n0000000555 00000 n\ntrailer << /Size 6 /Root 1 0 R >>\nstartxref\n632\n%%EOF`;\nreturn {\njson: {\ndocumentType: \"SIGNED_EXECUTIVE_CONTRACT\",\nfileName: \"alexander_vance_contract.pdf\"\n},\nbinary: {\ndata: {\ndata: Buffer.from(contractPdf).toString('base64'),\nmimeType: \"application/pdf\",\nfileName: \"alexander_vance_contract.pdf\"\n}\n}\n};"
      },
